#: applications/luci-app-fwknopd/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/fwknopd.js:481
msgid ""
"Parses the /etc/fwknop/access.conf file (and included files/folders/keys) "
"and generates QR codes for all found stanzas. Handles only files in "
"/etc/fwknop folder due to access rights restrictions."
msgstr ""
"Parser /etc/fwknop/access.conf-filen (og inkluderte filer/mapper/nøkler) og "
"genererer QR-koder for alle funnet strofer. Håndterer kun filer i "
"/etc/fwknop-mappen på grunn av tilgangsrettighetsbegrensninger."

#: applications/luci-app-fwknopd/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/fwknopd.js:418
